// Shared build configuration, checked into git.
//
// Signing identity is per-machine, so it lives in Config/Local.xcconfig,
// which is gitignored. The optional include below means a machine without
// that file still builds — DEVELOPMENT_TEAM resolves to empty, and Xcode
// falls back to ad-hoc "Sign to Run Locally". Fine for a locally built
// Mac app; needed only for distribution/notarization.
//
// To use your own team: create Config/Local.xcconfig containing
//     PETEKM_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
// Do not set the team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab — that writes
// it back into project.pbxproj and conflicts on every pull.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = $(PETEKM_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM)
